# The flash accesses of the SRM console V7.3-1 on an ES40 (cl67srmrom.exe), recorded with
# ALPHABOX_RECORD=raw,flash by srm_probe.sh with CMDS="set auto_action halt" from a blank flash
# (alphabox 3d61174). Kept, in order: the boot (autoselect, ID reads, reset, the first reads), the
# sector erase with the reads around it, the 96 program cycles from the first byte that is not
# ff, and the last two cycles. What was left out is reads in read mode and programs of ff into
# erased bytes, which change nothing, so the replay from a blank flash sees the same answers.
# test/unit/flash_test.cpp replays it.
