flash cpu0 w 0 aaa80 64 55
flash cpu0 w 0 155540 64 90
flash cpu0 r 0 0 64 1
flash cpu0 r 0 80 64 0
flash cpu0 r 0 80 64 0
flash cpu0 r 0 40 64 ad
flash cpu0 r 0 40 64 ad
